# The debuggers and tracers whose job is another program's memory: what they do to it is recorded and never said
# (INJECTION, in amethystora-security-watch). The programs of the dx image's gdb, strace, ltrace, valgrind and
# perf, and of CRIU and scanmem for whoever installs them, as `dnf repoquery -l` lists them for Fedora 44. One
# program a line, under /usr only: one anywhere an account can write would let anything call itself a debugger.
/usr/bin/gdb
/usr/libexec/gdb
/usr/bin/gdbserver
/usr/bin/strace
/usr/bin/ltrace
/usr/bin/valgrind
/usr/bin/perf
/usr/bin/criu
/usr/bin/scanmem
